# Frontend config. Copy to `.env` and edit. Vite only exposes variables
# prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.

# Backend API base URL. In dev (vite dev server) leave blank to use the
# built-in proxy configured in vite.config.ts. In production builds served
# by nginx, also leave blank — nginx reverse-proxies /api/v1 to the server
# container. Only set this when the frontend and server run on separate
# origins without a reverse proxy.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com

# Dev server port. Vite reads this automatically.
# VITE_PORT=5173
